      "summary": "CPPU, in Langfang, describes itself as a full-time university run directly by China’s Ministry of Public Security. It began in 1981 as the Chinese People’s Armed Police Force Academy, which trained officers for the border defence, firefighting and guard forces, and became CPPU in the 2018 reorganisation of party and state bodies; it also operates as the ministry’s International Law Enforcement Cooperation College and as the China Peacekeeping Police Training Center.",
